e Lost Legend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/us0mTpTmGCDboPpgddjcw6nYPQH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three tomb raiders retire from their roles and move to New York to enjoy the rest of their lives. However, they are asked to resume duty in order to find out the reason behind the loss of a loved one.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1353117,\"title\":\"Home Sweet Home: Rebirth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9rCBCm9cyI4JfLEhx3EncyncMR3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wmqpE7p2dUCEgCnovuovoNXaCXr.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a city is overrun with a demonically-possessed crowd, a cop must find the source of evil to save his family.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10004,\"title\":\"Desperation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sVVTUA9SBaGlkZcj3XIJq077dQB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zwgje2ruELJGHEZcSwq287o5Qo3.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a sheriff arrests a writer, a family, a couple, and a hitchiker and throws them in a jail cell in the deserted town of Desperation, they must fight for their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9616,\"title\":\"The Order\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7kj4TffoKCt4gIrNupr2oqmir69.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7KBJf963tZBijpP6bKOJrxkowGp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For centuries, a secret Order of priests has existed within the Church. A renegade priest, Father Alex Bernier, is sent to Rome to investigate the mysterious death of one of the Order's most revered members. Following a series of strangely similar killings, Bernier launches an investigation that forces him to confront unimaginable evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":421792,\"title\":\"Down a Dark Hall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r3zuws3fT9zC7s8LILqEY9smjN0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eoTjilPmObqBMcXaBDBYTIPdB7e.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kit, a troubled girl, is sent to the exclusive Blackwood boarding school, where she discovers that only four other female students have been admitted to learn the four pillars of knowledge under the ominous wing of the mysterious headmistress Madame Duret.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":43935,\"title\":\"Dylan Dog: Dead of Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZdYn5IktnGVg7pRA2JHD1rdZDH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mbxu6J4qZ69JWNKITrHiR60IXx8.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Supernatural private eye, Dylan Dog, seeks out the monsters of the Louisiana bayou in his signature red shirt, black jacket and blue jeans.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9707,\"title\":\"Bubba Ho-tep\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pKQBit5ZV7GEOTiMBSYC6xBn86K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TpUjiwMYtASIJYbtuyPkCe4kKw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The \\\"true\\\" story of what really became of Elvis Presley. We find Elvis as an elderly resident in an East Texas rest home, who switched identities with an Elvis impersonator years before his \\\"death,\\\" then missed his chance to switch back. He must team up with JFK and fight an ancient Egyptian mummy for the souls of their fellow residents.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":782936,\"title\":\"Nocebo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3FPnDTlX0LsaU4VD5mc82BMbchA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mIrNZQw4u9fpGyllxoYEmQrdYR5.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A fashion designer suffers from a mysterious illness that puzzles her doctors and frustrates her husband until help arrives in the form of a Filipino caregiver who uses traditional folk healing to reveal a horrifying truth.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":741434,\"title\":\"Homunculus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnqmGW6N9fxEyPEylC2qT4bbUmd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1eTfD2dnT5FbVZwgdJJISjzh2Fm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A homeless man meets a medical school student who pays him to volunteer for a surgical procedure known as trepanation, drilling a hole in his skull, which ends up giving him the ability to communicate with the dark side of people’s subconscious minds.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":504631,\"title\":\"Mermaid Down\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oB281saxibom0KC3Ndz81aJJtaa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7cQKUEcRkw2EeK7KDn8eRqS3XkC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mermaid is ripped from the ocean by a fishing crew only to be tortured and to have her tail cut off. A seemingly helpful stranger intervenes, but then locks her away in an institution for mentally disturbed young women, where no one believes she is a mermaid. With no way out, she is forced to count on her survival instincts, and fight for her life at all costs.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":480210,\"title\":\"Truth or Dare\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l5Dyos3xViHP5ROuCi01P9Q6nZA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hnFln3IyJkw1J1j1EoyCuNUPTpq.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Eight college friends head to a \\\"Haunted Rental\\\" in a remote town for Halloween weekend. There, they play the game rumored to have caused the deaths of seven teenagers decades earlier, Truth or Dare. What starts out as vodka-fueled fun quickly turns serious when the dares become sickeningly dangerous and the truths threaten to tear the group apart. When players attempt to refuse the increasingly challenging tasks, they're met with deadly consequences, quickly discovering: you must do the dare, or the dare does you. As the death toll mounts, the remaining players must race against the clock to outrun, outsmart and outlast the simple game of Truth or Dare.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ht1M5GlEgW4\",\"name\":\"The Haunting (1999) Original Trailer [HD]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"byjAO1oSzZg\",\"name\":\"Theatrical Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"aTKKV3rwPno\",\"name\":\"Teaser Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}